<title>FRANCE: Cap 1996 net attrib profit 280 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Cap 1996 net attrib profit 280 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     280  vs		52</p>
<p>    Net attributable per share (francs)   4.64  vs	    0.99</p>
<p>    Net attributable before goodwill	 426  vs	     146</p>
<p>    Operating				    1,040  vs	     678</p>
<p>    Turnover				    14,810  vs	  11,329</p>
<p>NOTE - Cap Gemini gave its results in a statement. The company said 1997 should see a further increasein turnover.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
